     1	# Run statement — model-only SPS ceiling probe (COMPONENT measurement, single GPU, ≤ 45 min)
     2	
     3	**Label: component measurement.** This probe times only the model's share of one PPO update. It gives an upper bound on env steps/s *if the engine, host copies, GAE, logging and DDP cost nothing*. It does **not** measure or prove end-to-end SPS (CLAUDE.md throughput rule), and every result derived from it is labeled that way.
